  "description": "What should you do in a stock market crash?",
  "body_html": "<p>Quick note: I will be out chaperoning a school field trip today. If you tag me, I will not respond until tomorrow. </p><p>Happy Tuesday! Thank you for all of the birthday wishes yesterday, I had a great day and a delicious vanilla and cream cheese bunt cake 🎂</p><p>I know the stock market has been boring. I see people leaving the markets already, largely from boredom. These are the same individuals that will return…AFTER… the stock market recovers. Boring is far better than crashing, in which <em><strong>the stock market is NOT crashing,</strong></em> at least not right now. </p><p>Consolidations have a tendency to grind out investors. They suck… but get used to them.</p><p>That said, lets pretend I am wrong. Instead of a blow off top to the upside (which I am still betting on), lets assume this narrative is incorrect. Stocks do start to break structure and crash down. </p><p>What do we do?</p><p>Simple: stop buying. </p><p>A stock in motion tends to stay in motion, and we <em><strong>do not fight trends. </strong></em></p><p>Rocket Labs, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RKLB&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; coreweave, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$CRWV&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; and SoFi Technologies, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SOFI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> are all in clear down trends. You do not need to get the bottom! These are some of the most talked about, downtrending assets I am seeing.    </p><p>I warned you all months ago, that the absolute flood of financial influencers, ever since the PDT rule went away back in June, that these influencers would begin bottom picking and dollar cost averaging. Netflix, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NFLX&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> is the best example of this. We saw influencers dip buying and dollar cost averaging when it was over $110 a share. Today, it sits at $69 a share.  </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><h4>Wait for strength. </h4><p>Trust me, I love it when I am popping out posts to you, with a fresh hot stock with a breakout. Then it spirals upwards. And we are all making tons of money. But that is not the market conditions right now. </p><ol><li><p>Do not fight trends. </p></li><li><p>Cut small losses before they become big losses. </p><ol><li><p>You can do this by controlling your position size (starting smaller or reducing position size) or using stops. </p></li><li><p>Ask yourself: “has this trade been invalidated?” or “Has price action broken structure?” If yes, trim or cut. </p></li></ol></li><li><p>Realize that the market does not always go strait up. Consolidations are normal. </p></li></ol><p>Again, I reiterate, I do not think that the stock market is crashing, or will imminently crash. It is simply <em><strong>grinding out retail investors right now.</strong></em> Yes, there are poor performing individual stocks, but that is normal to have some duds. The S&amp;P 500 remains in a clear, well defined, uptrend. </p><p>Just a quick update for everyone before I head out the door. Have a great day and I will talk to you all tomorrow. </p><h4><strong>If you like this content, please like ❤️ and re-stack 🔄, it really helps and only takes a second. </strong></h4><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W3S9!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8add7fc9-8edc-4748-ba33-360428e75ee1_1206x1206.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
